# Review is required from the listed owner for changes to these paths.
# Needs branch protection with "Require review from Code Owners" enabled to be enforced.

# Anything under .claude/ runs on a contributor's machine during a session.
# A change here is an execution-surface change, so it never merges unreviewed.
/.claude/                   @arnelirobles

# Shared build configuration: a mistake here affects every project at once.
/Directory.Build.props      @arnelirobles
/Directory.Packages.props   @arnelirobles
/.editorconfig              @arnelirobles

# CI, release and deployment.
/.github/                   @arnelirobles

# The working agreement itself.
/CLAUDE.md                  @arnelirobles
/AGENTS.md                  @arnelirobles
/CONTRIBUTING.md            @arnelirobles
/.cursorrules               @arnelirobles
